{"id":"ambicio_n","lemma":"ambición","pos":"noun","rank":3596,"glosses":["ambition"],"ipa":"/ambiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ambiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ambici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su ambición es ser abogado.","en":"His ambition is to be a lawyer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733554","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"lawyer"}]},{"text":"Su ambición le hacía trabajar duro.","en":"His ambition made him work hard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705874","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"hard"}]},{"text":"Mi profesor me animó a cumplir mis ambiciones.","en":"My teacher encouraged me to fulfill my ambitions.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"professor"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to inspire","l":"animar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to fulfil"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Su ambición lo llevó a asesinar.","en":"Ambition drove him to murder.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to murder"}]},{"text":"Cuando él era niño, su ambición era ser profesor de inglés.","en":"When he was a child, his ambition was to be an English teacher.","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"child, boy"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"professor"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"English"}]}]}